#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/multi-track.rst:2
msgid "Multi-Track Algorithm"
msgstr "多目标跟踪算法"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/multi-track.rst:4
msgid ""
"Multi-track is a simple multiple object tracking algorithm for the CMUcam3 "
"developed by Steve Sherman for Dr. Derek Paley at the University of Maryland"
" College Park Collective Dynamics and Control Lab. The core of the algorithm"
" is to call simple simple color track on small areas of the image frame and "
"then merge the returned bounding boxes back together to give a list of found"
" objects."
msgstr ""
"Multi-track 是一个用于 CMUcam3 的简单多目标跟踪算法，由 Steve Sherman 为马里兰大学帕克分校集体动力学与控制实验室的 "
"Derek Paley 博士开发。该算法的核心是在图像帧的小区域上调用简单的颜色跟踪，然后将返回的边界框合并在一起，从而给出找到的物体列表。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/multi-track.rst:10
msgid ""
"On a typical three channel full resolution image, multitrack will take "
"around 450 ms to execute. This is comparison to 300ms for "
"simple_color_track, and 200ms for a basic bright pixel search. On a full "
"resolution single channel image, multitrack will take ~340ms, simple color "
"track ~200ms and bright pixel approximately 150ms. I'm sure there are many "
"optimizations to be made, so feel free to tinker and improve the algorithm."
msgstr ""
"在典型的三通道全分辨率图像上，multitrack 执行大约需要 450 毫秒。相比之下，simple_color_track 为 300 "
"毫秒，基本的亮像素搜索为 200 毫秒。在全分辨率单通道图像上，multitrack 大约需要 340 毫秒，简单颜色跟踪约 200 毫秒，亮像素约 "
"150 毫秒。我确信还有许多可以进行的优化，因此欢迎随意调整和改进该算法。"

